###################################################################################
This Readme file contains a description of the SDP.81 Band 7
ALMA 2014 Long Baseline Campaign Science Verification 
data, scripts and data products. 

Spectral windows include continuum (290 GHz) and the redshifted CO J=10-9 line
(rest frequency 1151.985 GHz).

The resolution achieved for the continuum data is 31 x 23 mas.

It was necessary to uv-taper the spectral line data so the resulting
angular resolution is coarser (up to 170 mas).

Additional information can be found at:
http://almascience.org/alma-data/science-verification

The Calibrated Data and Reference Images provided here were produced using
CASA version 4.2.2.

The imaging scripts and other imaging details can be found at the following
CASA guide page:
http://casaguides.nrao.edu/index.php?title=ALMA2014_LBC_SVDATA

